  "details": "On the instance lists of the VRChat website, it is not possible to see which group is the owner of each instance. Can't even see it on the instance's page.\n\nSame issue can be seen with private (Friends and Friends+) instances, but this is usually not as big an issue.\n\nThis issue also exists on the VRChat Android application, see: [android-cant-see-owner-of-group-instances](https://feedback.vrchat.com/mobile-alpha/p/android-cant-see-owner-of-group-instances)",
